# Reviewer screenshots. Regenerable, and PNG at 1440px is 6 MB a shot that git
# cannot delta — fourteen clients would put a quarter of a gigabyte of working
# artefacts in the history. A passing demo keeps a small webp pair instead.
clients/*/shots/
tools/.rev-*
tools/.*.tmp.mjs
dist-demos/
